    defectTags:
    - kotor
    - berdebu
    correctDecision: 1
    explanation: Lap dengan kain atau wipe lembut dan jangan membasahi sensor.
  - caseImage: {fileID: 4268674502242137220, guid: ebe9b5db0004be345a0b835e83e59e5e, type: 3}
    equipment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7678f77abb801204791806f54127c917, type: 2}
    caseType: 0
    condition: Indikator baterai redup dan sensor terkadang telat bereaksi, padahal
